<Folder><name>Group 7</name>
<Placemark><name>G7 START</name><description>Junction of Soi Suksamur 4 &amp; Krommaluang Chumphon Rd (ถ.กรมหลวงชุมพร)</description><Point><coordinates>99.1813,10.50069,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G7 step 1: Soi Suksamur 4</name><description>Start here. Head south along Soi Suksamur 4 for about 230 m to the junction with Soi Suksamur 9.</description><styleUrl>#g7film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.1813,10.50069,0 99.18111,10.49952,0 99.18107,10.49918,0 99.18106,10.49903,0 99.18104,10.49885,0 99.18105,10.49867,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G7 step 2: Suksamur Rd</name><description>Continue straight onto Suksamur Rd (ถ.สุขเสมอ), heading south for about 400 m, passing Soi Pisist Payabal 3/3, Soi Suksamur 9, Soi Suksamur 7, Soi Suksamur 5, to where it meets Prachauthid Rd (ถ.ประชาอุทิศ).</description><styleUrl>#g7film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18105,10.49867,0 99.18105,10.4984,0 99.18106,10.4976,0 99.18106,10.49728,0 99.18106,10.49684,0 99.18107,10.49638,0 99.18107,10.49589,0 99.18107,10.49543,0 99.18108,10.49508,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G7 step 3: Prachauthid Rd</name><description>Turn left onto Prachauthid Rd (ถ.ประชาอุทิศ), heading east for about 480 m, passing Soi Pisist Payabal 1, Soi Pisit Payaban 6, Soi Pisist Payabal 1/1, Soi Pisist Payabal 3, to the junction with Sanam Kila Rd (ถ.สนามกีฬา) / Phisit Phayaban Rd (ถ.พิศิษฐ์พยาบาล).</description><styleUrl>#g7film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18108,10.49508,0 99.18153,10.49524,0 99.18183,10.49534,0 99.1821,10.49543,0 99.18267,10.49564,0 99.18322,10.49583,0 99.18371,10.49602,0 99.18456,10.49633,0 99.18524,10.49657,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G7 step 4: Saha Korn Rd</name><description>Turn right onto Saha Korn Rd (ถ.สหกรณ์), heading south for about 410 m, passing Soi Saha Korn 1, Soi Saha Korn 2, Soi Saha Korn 6, Soi Saha Korn 3, to the finish point.</description><styleUrl>#g7film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18524,10.49657,0 99.18513,10.49563,0 99.18512,10.49549,0 99.18509,10.49485,0 99.18509,10.49483,0 99.18506,10.49461,0 99.18502,10.49399,0 99.18503,10.49375,0 99.18505,10.49354,0 99.18509,10.49341,0 99.18514,10.49329,0 99.18519,10.49321,0 99.18534,10.49291,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G7 FINISH</name><description>Junction of Saha Korn Rd (ถ.สหกรณ์) &amp; Soi linking Poramin Mankha Rd and Saha Korn Rd (ซอยเชื่อม ถ.ปรมินทรมรรคา–ถ.สหกรณ์)</description><Point><coordinates>99.18534,10.49291,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder>
